<div class="nav-panel">
<p>
Next: <a href="rm-invocation.html" accesskey="n" rel="next"><code class="command">rm</code>: Remove files or directories</a>, Previous: <a href="install-invocation.html" accesskey="p" rel="prev"><code class="command">install</code>: Copy files and set attributes</a>, Up: <a href="Basic-operations.html" accesskey="u" rel="up">Basic operations</a> &nbsp; [<a href="index.html#SEC_Contents" title="Table of contents" rel="contents">Contents</a>][<a href="Concept-index.html" title="Index" rel="index">Index</a>]</p>
